MerkleAdapterDeallocatable
├── when no liquidity has been released
│   ├── it returns zero even when accounted NAV is invalid
│   ├── it skips an unavailable underlying balance read
│   └── it cannot bypass the delegator's final NAV validation
└── when liquidity has been released
    ├── it still rejects invalid accounted NAV
    ├── it still requires a successful underlying balance read
    ├── it still rejects invalid NAV when the requested return is zero
    └── it still requires a successful cash read when the requested return is zero
